 96	  \[
 97	    \zeta_{\mathrm{variance}} = 24m\cdot\Big(\eps + \delta + \frac{md}{q}\Big).
 98	  \]
 99	  Lemma~\ref{lem:add-in-u} below is the technical transfer from the averaged family~$H$ back to the sandwiched operators $A^u_{h(u)}T_hA^u_{h(u)}$. We use it in the completeness, consistency, strong self-consistency, and boundedness estimates that follow.
100	
101	  We now verify the four conclusions of Lemma~\ref{lem:self-improvement-helper}.
